      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I completly agree, and I just posted on another topic about it. a limit of 200 to 250mb would be plenty for people to work with without killing any hardware. this 100 limit just limits quest players from really good worlds that might even be just over that limit. look at furrality, they had massive worlds that supported quest, this shouldn't just be limited to big special events.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
