  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-11-01T23:56:58.699Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "100MB is starting to become very limiting to people. As Q1 is not supported anymore and more and more players move to Q3, upping the size limit for uploaded worlds would help so much. For example we currently bake shadows to save on performance of realtime lighting but that's starting to become not viable at bigger scales as the lightmaps themselves take 80MB+ of space. These VR headsets have at minimum 128GB, they should be able to handle world sizes being higher than 100MB, especially with the crackdown on avatar limits. I've even compiled similar requests into this post. \n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/quest-world-size-increased\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/increase-world-size-limit-for-quest\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/a-further-expansion-to-world-size-limits-for-oculus-quest",
